'''Manic Eraser Cat''' (大狂乱のゴムネコ ''Dai Kyōran no Gomu Neko'', '''Insane Eraser Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy found in [[Vulcanizer (Deadly)|Vulcanizer]]. She was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Manic Eraser Cat
|image = E 243.png
|appearance = [[Vulcanizer (Deadly)]]
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 32|Infernal Tower - Floor 32]]
|money drop = 2,370¢ - 9,361¢
}}

==Enemy==
Manic Eraser Cat has extreme health and damage. She retains the [[Base Destroyer]] ability and range of [[Crazed Tank Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Tank Cat]], but they're largely similar. The real problem is the much stronger support she usually appears with, where in [[Vulcanizer (Deadly)|Vulcanizer]] she's supported by stronger variants of the peons in [[Absolute Defense (Insane)|Absolute Defence]], being [[Gory Dark|Gory Darks]] and [[Capy|Capies]], and in [[Infernal Tower/Floor 32|Floor 32]] of Infernal Tower she's supported by [[Midnite D.|Midnite Ds]]. All of these hard-pushing peons combined with the Base Destroyer ability of the Manic Eraser, along with her insanely high health and lack of knockbacks will inevitably lead to a defeat if you don't maintain your ground against her.

